- `/private/var/folders/_q/qzh8_t6s15388qqf3p6n3d200000gp/T/bench-0dvg0p66/src/cli/commands/lint.rs` (2 instances of silent default)
- `/private/var/folders/_q/qzh8_t6s15388qqf3p6n3d200000gp/T/bench-0dvg0p66/src/cli/commands/list.rs` (3 instances of silent error swallowing)
- `/private/var/folders/_q/qzh8_t6s15388qqf3p6n3d200000gp/T/bench-0dvg0p66/src/cli/commands/templates.rs` (1 instance, somewhat intentional)
- `/private/var/folders/_q/qzh8_t6s15388qqf3p6n3d200000gp/T/bench-0dvg0p66/src/config/schema.rs` (root cause)

The most concerning patterns are in `list.rs` where `.ok()` is used to silently ignore parse errors on individual step and workflow files, and in `lint.rs` where a missing project config silently falls back to defaults when linting individual workflow/step files.

