**Issue**: ConfigParseError will propagate, but ConfigNotFound silently returns the built-in registry. This is somewhat intentional (documented in the comment), but it means if a user has an invalid merged config, they won't see an error - they'll just get the default templates. However, this one is less problematic since an actual parse error is still returned.

